+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/rates/import — set a rate per pasted line. Body {"text":"..."}, lines of grade,rate,from,to
+# (the last two may be absent or blank). Every line is checked first by the rate form's rules: 400 for a bad line or
+# none, and then nothing is stored. Otherwise each is set in order as the form sets it (replacing a rate for the same
+# grade and from-date; RATE_SET, then its ROLLUP lines). Responds {"set":n}.
